    {
      "q": "How do I update my name on my NSW Digital ID?",
      "a": "You must log in to your MyServiceNSW Account, go to 'Manage account', then 'Security and settings', and finally 'Manage NSW Digital ID'. You can then follow the instructions to verify your identity with documents in your new name.",
      "link": null
    },
    {
      "q": "What should I do if I need to remove my NSW Digital ID first?",
      "a": "You can select 'Deactivate' and follow the instructions to remove your NSW Digital ID before proceeding with the update.",
